00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.410
Happy New Year!

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.790
Like always, today is January 7 of the lunar calendar,

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:39.830
Glory Pro League starts right here and now.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.790
Now it's Tyranny vs. Excellent Era on team competition.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:45.200
We're seeing a 3-2 right now.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.290
Excellent Era is winning.

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:50.410
Su Mucheng stroke again.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.290
Her combat style has changed a lot.

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.790
From being the side support to the main attack.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.330
Unfortunately, her teammates
didn't play with this attack in time.

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.290
Zhang Xinjie had a great tactical arrangement.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.080
Tyranny having continuous good strikes.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:08.040
Excellent Era is now at absolute disadvantage.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.850
(Defeated)

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:14.910
They lost again.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:16.910
Does Sun Xiang even know how to play with the team?

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:20.160
You know why did Mumu change her style?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:24.330
The way she used to do requires response
from the main attack to deal damage.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:27.930
They have no teamwork right now, so she's
better off to carry out damage output by herself.

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:29.580
But...

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.160
What the heck is Excellent Era doing?

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:33.000
They even lost to Tyranny.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:33.580
I can't stand it!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.790
I don't understand their tactics.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.100
Tactics?

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:37.040
They ain't got no tactics at all.

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:39.200
It was Zhang Xinjie on the other side.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.200
Zhang Xinjie?

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:44.140
One of the four Master Tacticians in Glory.

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:49.470
(Zhang Xinjie, Xiao Shiqin, Yu Wenzhou, Ye Xiu)

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.080
They do lack a tactician.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.160
This season, Excellent Era is pretty much done.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:58.700
They got what they deserve.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.520
(Happy Net Cafe)

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.350
(Lord Grim, Lv 50)

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:12.950
You're Level 50 now?

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:17.660
Heavenly Domain, I'm coming.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:45.390
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.520
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.060
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:57.020
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:04.390
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:07.770
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.270
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:14.770
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.390
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:19.890
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.680
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:26.890
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.310
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:35.470
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:36.560
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.140
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.520
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:45.220
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:48.470
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:57.020
<b>Heavenly Domain</b>

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:06.000
Heavenly Domain is a public map
opened on the fifth year in Glory.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.060
In here, the dungeons are more difficult.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:12.020
With better materials.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:16.770
In order to encourage PVP, the drop rate
when played got killed is extremely high.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.650
All masters will eventually meet in Heavenly Domain.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.150
Here is the final land for the players to fight for.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.310
Are you going to start now?

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:30.270
(Heavenly Domain Challenge)

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.180
The challenges in Heavenly Domain
are mainly divided into two categories.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.150
Arena
Mission

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:33.560
(Heavenly Domain Challenge)

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.400
Missions and Arena.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:35.910
(Heavenly Domain Challenge)

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:39.000
In the Missions, addition to the regular bosses and material collect.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:39.020
