Mission
Arena

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:42.020
One thing that really bothers the players is the Skill Challenge.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:47.190
But to this guy, I don't think it's even worth mentioning.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.270
Completing the mission can get the following rewards
Mr. Li at the entrance of the village looks very anxious, as if

