Kill the 70-level BOSS Livid Shadow Cat

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:12.900
Go solo with that boss with a 20 level gap?
Completing the mission can get the following rewards

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.520
You can really do it?

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.100
The system can't stop him at all.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:27.270
But the other challenge.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.070
(Heavenly Domain Challenge)
Arena
Mission

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:30.600
Ye Xiu.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:33.090
Arena mission needs you to pick on
someone from no lower than your level.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.310
But you're already the top in the 10th server.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:36.810
Have you figured out what to do yet?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.270
I have to wait.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.900
Wait for others to catch up with me.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.690
What a waste of time.

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:04.060
Hello.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:06.020
Happy New Year.

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:06.770
Guoguo!

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:08.190
Little Tang?

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.020
You're back!

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.480
How's the traffic?

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:11.060
Not so bad.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:13.400
You got a lot of people here today.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:15.400
He's good!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:16.900
What's going on over there?

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.770
I mean, am I seeing an Unspecialized now?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:20.750
You ain't go no EXP with that class after level 50.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:21.240
Woah, that combo.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:23.390
Ye Xiu's on his mission in Heavenly Domain.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.620
That's why we got that fuss.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.520
Bro, you are good!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.900
I've never seen a level 50 to challenge this mission.

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:31.350
You're back?

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:33.650
This...

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:34.810
I've seen it before.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.060
I helped Guoguo with this mission before.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:39.560
You need others' hands for basic skills like this?

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:40.600
Shame on you.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.100
I found it difficult.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:42.810
Is that a crime?

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:43.770
Boss, you...

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:45.190
Go mind your own business.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:47.270
Can I take this mission right now?

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:47.900
Not yet.

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:51.400
I'll go do some more trainings then.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:53.400
You're not gonna try it?

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:55.270
You just said, I'm not yet there.

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:58.060
You're getting more like a pro now.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:02.970
Ye Xiu.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:03.060
Do you want to continue to challenge the next mission?
Congratulations on completing 33rd mission.
Ye Xiu.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:03.310
Congratulations on completing 33rd mission.
Do you want to continue to challenge the next mission?

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.020
How you doing?
Congratulations on completing 33rd mission.
Do you want to continue to challenge the next mission?

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:04.180
Congratulations on completing 33rd mission.
Do you want to continue to challenge the next mission?

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:04.270
(10th Server Player Ranking: 1st Lord Grim, level 50)

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.020
Not bad.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:05.940
(10th Server Player Ranking: 1st Lord Grim, level 50)

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.940
It's just that this Arena, I can't find someone
to do PVP in the 10th server.

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.850
I mean, brother you care to fight me?

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.440
I'm from 8th server, my account name is The Lift.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:17.250
Man!

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:18.650
What's up?

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.350
Nothing.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.190
You go set the room. I'll be right with you.

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:22.900
Great!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:24.060
Are you okay?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.520
I'm so stupid.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:27.270
Yeah I can see that.

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:29.270
How can I forget this basic setting?

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.190
You don't have to be in the same server to fight in Arena.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:32.940
Why don't you remind me?

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:35.150
Right!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:37.770
Well, problem's solved then.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.150
Arena,

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.310
here we go.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:10.440
Did you hear that, these is a newcomer in Arena recently.

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:13.650
Only level 50 but he dares to challenge full level players.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:15.770
Seriously? That's a 20 level gap.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:16.520
Not kidding.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:17.650
He won every single fight!

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:19.400
He's got 59 wins in a row.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:20.150
GM, I want to report! Lord Grim is using a trainer!
Problem Description:

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:21.400
He must be cheating!

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:21.770
GM, I want to report! Lord Grim is using a trainer!
Problem Description:

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.230
GM, I want to report!

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.520
Lord Grim using a trainer!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:24.810
GM, I want to report! Lord Grim is using a trainer!
Problem Description:

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:25.400
After system verification, the player account is normal.
Thank you for your letter,

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:28.270
We looked into the data, the said player
is not involved in a such activity.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.400
See that?

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.480
He's got real moves!

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.150
You don't know Lord Grim?

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.310
He's our legend in 10th server.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:36.440
Room 1369.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:37.020
Come see for it yourself.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:53.400
Boss, you're Almighty!

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:54.770
You will have a sure win!

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:58.020
He's really about to complete the challenge in Heavenly Domain.

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:59.310
We should try to catch up.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:04.520
Lord Grim?

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.650
Unspecialized with self-made silver weapon.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.020
Interesting.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:13.440
When he gets to Heavenly Domain, let's go meet him.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.000
(Excellent Era)

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:21.650
Manager Cui, The progression in 10th server is going nowhere.

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:23.650
It's mainly because of Ye Qiu.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.730
He's got all the dungeon record clear.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:27.270
Go on.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:30.150
He and his Happy Guild had it all.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:33.060
He challenged Heavenly Domain
at level 50, and made a big fuss.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:34.960
What a disgrace.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.770
He used to be a Pro gamer.

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:39.770
Didn't expect him to show off in online game like this.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:42.900
Manager Cui, what should we do now?

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.270
The other guilds should know who he is by now.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:46.520
What did they do?

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.060
They...

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.060
They gave in.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.850
Including Tyranny?

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:53.690
Yes.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:57.270
Are we really gonna sit and watch him rise again?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.100
There's a rumor

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.020
saying that Ye Qiu is going to start his own team.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:14.020
If that's true,

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.400
even though he did contribute to Excellent Era,

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.900
he would still be our competitor.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:19.810
We wish him all the best.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.770
But as rivals,

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:25.150
no one knows how great can he be better than we do.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.980
Therefore, we should be prepared.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:47.170
<b>Arena mission clear!</b>

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:49.060
<b>Are you going to enter Heavenly Domain?</b>

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:52.550
<b>Flowing Tree requests to fight with you</b>

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:53.050
(Refuse)

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:56.500
Ye Xiu, you can't do this!

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:59.150
You got all those time to fight others but not me?

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:00.020
I'm just doing the mission.

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:01.310
Your level is lower than mine.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:02.270
Please get lost yourself.
(Flowing Tree has been kicked out)

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:03.770
Wait till you get into Heavenly Domain!

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:04.350
Watch me!

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:10.640
Yes
No
Are you going to enter Heavenly Domain?

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:30.650
(Announcement: Lord Grim from 10th server has now entered Heavenly Domain)

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:39.570
The King's Avatar 2

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:42.970
(Heavenly Domain)

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.770
It's you.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.900
Why are you so freak-out?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.520
I have to stay vigilant in Heavenly Domain.

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:04.270
For other guilds, this is their base camp.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:08.190
I'm just a poor level 50.

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:09.730
You think they're going to let me walk?

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.520
Don't be so melodramatic.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:12.310
You see?

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:13.440
That's what I'm talking about.

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:19.020
You have to protect me.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:25.810
It's Loulan Slash.

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:28.060
Who?

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:30.690
Leader of Heavenly Sword, very loaded.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:32.150
It is said that he is from a wealthy family.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.560
Got nothing to do with the guilds that's after you.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:39.310
Nice to meet you.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:40.690
Hello.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.440
Lord Grim.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:42.900
I've heard so much about you.

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:43.980
Loulan Slash.

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:44.900
Same here.

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:47.100
You just knew him, like a minute ago.

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:49.060
Just trying to be polite.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:50.520
I don't think they know me either.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.270
You are amazing.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:54.810
Got into Heavenly Domain at level 50.

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.060
Which server were you in?

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:59.020
Do we know each other from your main account?

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:01.270
1st server.

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:02.810
But I laid off for a long time.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:04.150
1st server?

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:05.560
Then he is one of the first ones.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.770
Do you have a main account in Heavenly Domain?

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:10.440
Not anymore.

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:12.650
Gave it to others?

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:14.850
What's your account ID?

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:16.600
One Autumn Leaf.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.730
The name is quite familiar.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:22.650
Do we really not know each other?

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:28.190
One Autumn Leaf...

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.400
One Autumn Leaf!

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:32.900
You are not saying you are Ye Qiu, are you?

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.020
I am.

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:43.400
This is all I wanna see.

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.440
Master Ye Qiu!

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:52.650
Can you prove it?

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.150
I don't have to.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:56.350
Take it or leave it.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:58.650
OK.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.650
If you are really Ye Qiu, that would be even better.

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:05.150
I heard that you try to start your own team again?

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:06.520
What a coincidence.

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:08.810
I'm building up a new team as well.

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.770
All I need is a master like you.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:12.350
Wanna come?

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.980
I can guarantee you the highest conditions in the League.

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:16.940
That's unfortunate.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.730
I've already signed him.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.250
And who are you?

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:21.980
I...

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:24.020
I'm his boss.

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:26.020
His boss?

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.150
What do you mean?

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:31.400
You are his sponsor?

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:35.310
Kind...

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.190
kind of.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:37.980
Yeah.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.900
She is now my boss.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:43.520
I see.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.270
That's a pity.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.900
So you're doing the level-up.

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:50.400
We will leave you to it.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:51.690
(Friend request from Loulan Slash)

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:52.350
Friend me.

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:53.900
Be in touch.

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:57.650
He just left like that?

00:14:58.050 --> 00:14:58.520
Or what?

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.270
Shouldn't he be writing you an empty check?

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:01.730
How much you want?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:02.270
Write it yourself.

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:03.400
Come with me or something like that.

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:04.690
Yeah.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:05.600
What a pity.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:08.310
Why didn't I bump into fools like that?

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:13.060
Yeah.

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.980
That man is really Master Ye Qiu?

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.060
It's hard to be sure for the time.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.520
But if he really is Ye Qiu, then all can be explained.

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:30.060
Level 50 to completed Heavenly Domain challenge.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.400
Self-made silver weapon.

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:35.940
If he's Ye Qiu, then it all makes sense.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:39.270
And no club wants him so far,

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:40.690
that says best about his identity.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:43.310
A great player with this kind of publicity,

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:45.810
signing him will definitely become the hot issue.

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.740
Great for marketing.

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:49.690
But no club's doing it?

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.810
Their hands must be tied somehow.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:54.270
Make sense.

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:55.940
If he's really Ye Qiu,

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:58.270
it'll take at least a year for him
to return after retirement.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:03.690
If we sign him, he won't be able to
re-register until this winter transfer window.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.650
You've gone too far ahead.

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:07.690
We didn't confirm his identity yet.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.060
Even if we did, you all heard that woman,

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.100
she is now the boss of Ye Qiu.

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.150
Ye Qiu also admitted.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:15.020
He has found a partner.

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:20.600
The woman, I think she is calling a bluff.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.440
She's not having enough confidence in their relationship.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.650
Even that suspected Ye Qiu looked calmer than she was.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.270
Then what should we do now?

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.190
Go back to our own business.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:30.650
As for that guy,

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:32.190
I'm going to keep an eye on him.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:42.400
I'm building up a new team as well.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.100
All I need is a master like you.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.310
That's unfortunate.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.060
I've already signed him.

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:51.440
What I did, would that be too selfish?

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.690
He can definitely have better options.

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:56.810
Ye Xiu.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:01.270
Actually Loulan Slash, they got great offer.

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.810
Do you want to...

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:05.770
What?

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:07.100
You gonna sell me to them?

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:08.810
I'm being serious here!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:09.940
I'm being serious as well.

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.400
I met him today.

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.400
I don't even know him, not to mention to work with him.

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:16.150
It's too early.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:18.690
I mean, Boss

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.060
learn from your elder brother here, OK?

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.650
I'm older than you, OK?

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.190
Didn't you say you gonna help me to level-up?

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.020
Be focus.

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:28.150
Coming.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.190
He's right.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.650
I'm over thinking this.

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:37.900
I've made up my mind to rebuild him a team.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.940
I should start from the things I could.

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:44.980
We have company again.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:48.850
No guild name.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:49.400
Gotta leave.

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:51.100
That could be Excellent Era.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:54.690
Even they are with Excellent Dynasty,
you don't be that nervous about it.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:55.560
I said Excellent Era.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:56.810
Not Excellent Dynasty.

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.790
You mean professional players?

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:03.270
He Ming.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:04.270
Liu Hao.

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:05.520
Wang Ze.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.520
Excellent Era sent out pros to hunt you down in Heavenly Domain?

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:10.690
Are they out of their freaking minds?

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:11.770
We have to separate.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:13.270
I'm not leaving.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.270
They're on to you.

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:15.190
Let's go fight them together!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:15.900
For what?

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:16.690
You're just gonna die in vain.

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:17.520
Use your brain.

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:19.520
I know I'm no-match to the pros.

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:21.440
I Just want to stay and fight with you.

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:22.900
I don't care if I have to die.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:24.400
Use me as a bait or something.

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:25.560
I'm totally fine with it.

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:28.650
Well follow my instructions then.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:31.270
Jump to 1456856.

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.150
Right on that stone.

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:40.560
And then?

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:41.400
Back.

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:42.900
A little more.

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:44.940
Right there.

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:45.810
And then what?

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:47.020
Wait for my instructions.

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.440
But up here, I don't see a thing.

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:09.270
Give me the mouse.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:11.560
Stinger.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.020
Seriously?

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:30.310
Grenade.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:32.020
Heat-Seeking Missile.

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:39.520
Satellite Beam.

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:47.440
Shit.

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:50.900
Satellite Beam!

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:57.270
This level of collaboration...

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.190
Is it...?

00:19:58.770 --> 00:19:59.400
Withdraw.

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:02.560
What happened?

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:04.770
They ran.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.100
They ran?

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:07.650
They were 3 to 2.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.270
Because you were just too good, Boss.

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:11.690
Scared them all away.

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:13.070
Don't make a fool of me.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.310
Because my left hand worked so well with right hand, OK?

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:16.650
Let's go.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.350
Good collaboration?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.690
They thought I was!

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:23.810
Su Mucheng!

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.480
That launcher was Su Mucheng?

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:28.560
It had to be.

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.150
That kind of control and coordination.

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:31.810
Who else could it be?

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:40.900
If it's Su Mucheng, then it's gonna be tough.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:47.730
Wait, who was that?

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.020
It seems to be Su Mucheng.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:51.440
It's Su Mucheng.

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:52.940
How could she be here?

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:56.770
If she's here, that means that Launcher was not Su Mucheng.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:00.440
Chasing Haze, who are you?

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:03.440
Chasing Haze?

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:05.060
I remember!

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:07.020
There was this video that went viral.

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:08.310
Got it.

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:10.440
Launcher Slayed Blue Brook Master.

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:12.100
That's the same account, right?

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:13.850
She fights different from Su Mucheng.

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:16.150
But judging from this short series of combos.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:17.900
She is also very good.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:20.060
Launcher's kill video?

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:23.520
That was Ye Qiu under Chasing Haze's account.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.270
Everybody in 10th server knows it.

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:27.190
It was Ye Qiu under that account?

00:21:27.690 --> 00:21:29.270
Then who was this Chasing Haze today?

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:32.810
Maybe a new talent he got for the team.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.270
We got ahead of ourselves.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:36.730
Let's take a pause right now.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.690
Let's get more Information about his crew.

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:41.770
When it comes to Ye Qiu,

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:45.270
I'm telling you, we won't be the ones who want him dead.

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:49.190
Excellent Era really got spooked away.

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:50.650
You got them.

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:54.310
Now we can go back to level-up.

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.940
This can only confuse them for a while.

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:57.940
Don't forget.

00:21:58.270 --> 00:21:59.650
We have other guilds onto us.

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:02.940
What can we do?

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:04.900
I'll figure it out.

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:32.470
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:22:33.890 --> 00:22:37.600
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:42.430
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:22:42.430 --> 00:22:44.600
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:49.220
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:22:49.560 --> 00:22:51.180
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:53.310
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:55.470
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:00.180
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:03.470
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:06.720
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:08.850
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:23:08.850 --> 00:23:10.560
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:12.350
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:15.600
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:19.600
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:21.770
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪

00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:50.950
Joining Heavenly Sword?

00:23:51.670 --> 00:23:52.450
What are you thinking?

00:23:52.550 --> 00:23:54.700
They want to play gimmicks? Let's give them gimmicks.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.720
Something just doesn't feel right.

00:23:58.070 --> 00:23:59.150
Do you think we should send a spy out there?

00:23:59.220 --> 00:24:00.200
You idiot!

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:02.400
You want the fans to find out that we're after him?

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:04.400
It's the master. Oh, my god!

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:06.150
I can't take this anymore.

00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:08.370
So you are really starting your own team.

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:10.400
I didn't bring out all my guns. You watch it.

00:24:11.750 --> 00:24:13.120
Woah, you're good!

00:24:13.370 --> 00:24:14.270
What should I do?

00:24:14.450 --> 00:24:15.650
You're not done with me?

00:24:15.650 --> 00:24:18.400
Phoenix Splash.
